WEBVTT

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:11.740
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.070
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:17.700
is true, yes it is.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.200
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.790
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:29.420
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:36.970
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:40.680
by ridding you...

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.850
...of your other love?

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:48.440
At sunset,

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:50.980
when the children go home,

00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:54.900
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:58.780
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.870
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:04.660
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:10.300
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.130
In a city without light,

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.010
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:19.430
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:21.720
The existence is a mistake

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:25.230
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:36.900
I'm Kurata Sana, a 6th grader
and TV personality.

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:39.570
Sagami Rei-kun. He's my
chauffeur and manager,

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.370
and used to be my boyfriend.

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:44.410
Hayama Akito. I don't know whether
he's my natural enemy or good friend,

00:01:44.410 --> 00:01:47.290
but recently, when I'm with him,
I feel relaxed.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:49.960
Mama, the Aoki Prize-winning writer.

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.960
Mama... I'm worried
about how Mama feels...

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:58.010
Hayama!

00:02:02.510 --> 00:02:05.520
That was fun! Like a
jet coaster in the dark!

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:06.980
Glad you liked it.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:34.500
Why is this? When I'm with Hayama,
I feel relieved.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.380
When did that start happening to me?

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:37.670
Are you...

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.340
...not wearing brassieres yet?

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:44.390
You letch!

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.600
Can't you tell when
I'm trying to be thoughtful,

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:48.730
by relieving some of the tension?

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:51.730
Don't you lie to me! You're just a letch!

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:56.860
Good grief, I'm coming in! Get me
something cool to drink, right away!

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.740
Maybe I should serve her
some noodle sauce.

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.740
Say, can I turn on the TV?

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.410
...even though I've already turned it on.

00:03:03.410 --> 00:03:04.780
...in an interview a short while ago,

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.750
--Kurata-san did not have any statements
concerning the content of her essay.
--Oh, they're at it now!

00:03:08.750 --> 00:03:10.750
We also have a report
that a boy riding on a bicycle

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.090
took away a girl that
appeared to be Sana-chan.

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:16.420
Unfortunately, that cannot be confirmed.

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:18.380
--Well, I wonder what that could be about.
--Thank goodness.

00:03:18.380 --> 00:03:19.420
--What, indeed.
--It looks like you didn't

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:20.760
--Here.
--appear on TV, Hayama.

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:23.090
--Well, let's move on to
Tokyo's own Obana Miho,
--Thank you.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:25.100
--The press was at school, too.
--and her "My Trivial Secrets" corner.

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:28.100
--My trivial secret is--
--They were, huh? I'm glad I stayed home.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:29.430
Hey, don't turn me off!

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:31.690
Why don't you hide here for a while?

00:03:31.690 --> 00:03:33.350
Huh? But...

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:36.360
My dad and everyone will
be completely okay with it.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:41.030
He's right. It is a
little suffocating at home...

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:44.700
That's the first time Mama
and Rei-kun ever got into a fight.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.620
I hate that.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:54.750
Huh...? Suddenly, I feel sleepy...

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.050
Wait! Don't fall asleep here!

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:07.050
Goodbye...

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:09.060
"Goodbye"? Hey, come on...!

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:17.520
"Sana grew up to be an incredibly
cheerful and spirited girl."

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.400
"I don't know how much of
the truth I told to Sana..."

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.400
I came in first in the race! Yay!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:27.410
"...about me not being her real mother,
and that there was another mother--

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.410
her real one--
out there somewhere.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:33.870
However, when I thought about

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.040
--how this little girl was worrying
inside her little head,
--Dinnertime.

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:41.050
and crying in secret,
even I was moved to tears.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:46.300
Sana was always the one
who truly understood me."

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:51.720
"When Gekidan Komawari had their
first theatrical production,

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.060
and my daughter was
chosen to play the lead,

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.350
"Yahoo Sana"
most of the other
children congratulated her,

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:57.520
"Yahoo Sana"
but one of them said it was only
because of her mother's influence.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.730
but one of them said it was only
because of her mother's influence.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:03.400
My daughter came and told me this
with great delight.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.070
--Apparently, she was completely unaware
that it was said out of spite,
--You have influence!

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:09.080
--and took it to be praise toward me."
--That's because you're
such an amazing person, Mama!

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:12.410
I love you, Mama! I love you!

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:17.380
"Young Sana's smiling face
always brought me happiness."

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:25.090
Sana-chan really does
love her mother, huh?

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:29.760
Hello, is this the Kurata-san residence?
This is Hayama...

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:31.890
Yes, I appreciate it.

00:05:33.350 --> 00:05:35.690
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:39.360
Yes... Yes... I see. I thought so.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:43.030
She has fallen fast asleep, so this
appears to be terribly hard on her.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:44.610
If it is all right with you,

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:47.700
we were thinking of letting her
stay here for two or three days.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.910
Is that so? That might allow
my daughter to feel better.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:54.370
The press corps still
has not left, and all.

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:58.880
I'm sorry to put you to all this trouble,
but yes, if you'd be so kind.

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.500
She went to the Hayama's house,
all right. Having her stay there

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:05.720
for two or three days would be better,
under the circumstances.

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:09.050
Yeah... Um, I'm sorry
about what I said earlier.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.050
It's all right.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:15.100
Still, please do not forget
how much Sana-chan loves you.

00:06:17.060 --> 00:06:21.270
Apparently, she's only worried
about how her mom is feeling.

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:26.530
It's as though she doesn't
care that she was abandoned,

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:27.900
or that everyone knows about it now.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:31.660
I don't even know how I
should act around Sana-chan.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.910
It would be best to just
act like you always do.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.710
Huh? It's night...

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:41.380
Hey, you sure slept well, Sana-chan.

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.670
No, that was way unnatural, Dad!

00:06:43.710 --> 00:06:45.250
We blew it.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:47.720
I'm so sorry I fell asleep!

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.720
Oh, no! What do I do!?

00:06:49.720 --> 00:06:52.680
It's okay. I've contacted
your house and everything.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:54.720
Oh, I'm hearing Father Hayama
from that direction...

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:57.730
Stay over, Sana-chan! I won't
let Akito do anything bad to you.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:07:00.020
Oh, Hayama's sister,
when did you get here?

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:04.070
Okay then, I guess
I'll take you up on it.

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:05.860
"Bathing time"
Bath! Bath! Babbit, ba-bang, bang, yay!

00:07:05.860 --> 00:07:08.400
Bath! Bath! Babbit, ba-bang, bang, yay!

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:11.030
Really, I still have
the figure of a little girl.

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:12.700
What are you talking about?

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:14.370
I don't even wear a brassiere yet.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:16.370
That's the Burutcha on top of her head.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.040
That's okay, that's okay.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.040
Ah, I'm getting dizzy.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.040
"Three stars down there..."

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:23.710
Sana-chan, those moles of yours
are unusual, huh?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:27.380
That's right. They're like the
three stars in the Orion constellation.

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:31.380
Mm-hmm. Akito has a mole right here.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.510
Oh, are you still in here?

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:39.020
Akito! How could you do that!?

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.020
You perve!

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.600
No doubt!

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:46.020
Peeping, huh?

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:50.150
"Hayama, are you really...?"

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:47.690
I hear that in Sweden,

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:50.070
there's a city called Scheveningen
("sukebe ningen," lecherous person).

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:53.200
Wow, this is your mother? How pretty!

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.030
Isn't she?

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:56.370
Nice going, Father Hayama.

00:07:56.370 --> 00:07:58.370
Sana-chan, you sound like an older man.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.580
There aren't very many photos
of Hayama... are there...?

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:05.750
Still, there are a few. Look!

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:11.170
How cute!

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.800
Is it... that funny?

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.390
What are you looking at?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.730
That's Hayama! That's Hayama!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:22.520
You're right!

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:28.730
What?

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:30.070
This picture of you, Akito!

00:08:30.070 --> 00:08:32.320
Natsumi! Why, you...! Don't do that!

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:34.660
You be quiet. And call me Sister.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:36.070
I saw it!

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:39.990
Hayama, you really do have
a mole right here, huh?

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:41.660
It's a little unusual, isn't it?

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:46.330
I have them, too. I was born with
three huge birthmarks, all in a row.

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:48.670
Right, like the three stars
in the Orion constellation.

00:08:48.670 --> 00:08:50.670
But I'm not telling you where they are.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:54.010
Nope, nope. We're not
telling you, Akito.

00:08:54.010 --> 00:08:55.680
--Right!
--Right!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.680
Mine are more unusual than yours.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:00.350
But we're not telling you where they are.

00:09:00.350 --> 00:09:01.350
--Right!
--Right!

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:03.020
--Your ass?
--Bingo!
--Bingo!

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.690
How did you know that!?

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:06.020
Huh? I was right?

00:09:06.020 --> 00:09:10.020
Oh, no! Don't tell anyone!
Only Mama knows, after all!

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.360
I wish we hadn't said anything.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.690
There, there.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:16.360
Don't worry. That topic
will never come up anywhere.

00:09:16.360 --> 00:09:18.700
It sure is loud in here.
What are you talking about?

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.700
Get this. She's got three moles on her--

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.370
Don't go telling him right off!

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:24.370
Sana-chan has three moles on her--

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:26.460
I said don't tell anyone!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.540
It's time for good little
boys and girls to go to bed.

00:09:42.010 --> 00:09:43.470
I can't sleep.

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:55.360
Yo.

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:58.030
Hayama...

00:09:58.030 --> 00:09:59.700
I couldn't sleep.

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.160
Me neither.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.390
You're not at all sleepy, Hayama?

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:21.390
Nah.

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:25.720
I wonder why. I did have that nap,
after all...

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:26.980
Yeah.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.650
I sure am hungry. Want to eat something?

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:34.650
Mm-hmm.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.990
We don't have anything decent at home.
What do you want to eat?

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:37.990
Let's see...

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:38.990
I'd like...

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.490
--Ramen!
--Ramen!

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:46.000
It's got to be ramen.

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:46.660
Yeah, huh?

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.290
Yeah, yeah!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:52.330
Ramen noodles... zzz...
tanmen noodles... chashao noodles...

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:55.670
Oh, we don't know what you're saying!
If you're too sleepy, don't even show up!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:58.340
It's rare that these two
can agree on anything, huh?

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:02.430
"Let's eat ramen"

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:00.340
When are you going to wake up?

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:02.470
My name is Babbit.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:06.680
Nothing.

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:10.270
It's no use! Once I feel hungry,
there's no going back!

00:11:10.270 --> 00:11:12.690
Ramen, ramen, ramen, ramen!

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.020
What do we do?

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:15.980
We'll have to go buy some.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:21.360
Right now? If I go outside,
the press corps will...

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:22.990
What if we disguise you?

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:27.700
Hmm, a disguise, eh? Mm-hmm...

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:32.370
We could do that, huh?
Disguise, disguise, hmm-hmm-hmm...

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:33.880
Ra-let's get some-men!

00:11:42.800 --> 00:11:46.470
Disguise! Indian!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:48.810
Stop that. It stands out too much.

00:11:48.810 --> 00:11:51.140
You look more like
an Arab than an Indian.

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.810
I'm an Indian! I've even got the incense.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:56.150
--Oh, since you're an Indian, I thought
you had to be carrying curry...
--Dress normally.

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:59.150
I know! If it's a disguise we need,
Hayama, get me a fake beard.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.650
I don't have anything like that.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.490
Let's go.

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:08.490
Act naturally.

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:12.160
We've got lots of fake
beards and wigs at my house.

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:14.420
On top of that, Hayama's clothes
fit me perfectly.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:16.840
I really do have the body of a child.

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:20.170
It's all right. You make a fine boy.

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:23.260
--Brassiere--
--Whoa, just leave it at that.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.680
Let's go buy some ramen!

00:12:30.180 --> 00:12:31.770
Come on, quit stalling.

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:32.770
You jerk!

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:34.440
This week's Akito-kun.

00:12:34.440 --> 00:12:36.810
Cut that out, or I'll kick you.

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.270
I shouldn't have done this...

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:41.190
"Zenjiro in a pinch!"

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:41.190
In my country, it's the
middle of the day right now.

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:44.280
--There they are, there they are,
--Some bento dinners

00:12:44.320 --> 00:12:45.320
--there they are, there they are.
--have arrived over there.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:47.450
I can't take it...

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:50.410
I get carried away and babble a
bunch of stuff that I shouldn't have,

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:53.160
and befo-uh you know it,
I'm digging my own grave.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:56.170
Hey, I hear that Zenjiro's
new girlfriend is 2m 50cm tall.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.420
--According to the
information that we have,
--What!?

00:12:58.420 --> 00:12:59.840
her neck is quite long,
and she's over 3 meters tall.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.170
--So, what about her weighing 4.5 tons?
--What's was that?

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.470
Boss, there is something on the roof!

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:06.470
--Oh, it's moving!
--What's going on?

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:08.140
--A giraffe? That's a giraffe!
--Just a minute!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.510
That's Zenjiro's new girlfriend!

00:13:09.510 --> 00:13:11.810
--Go! Ambush interview!
--Oh, no!

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.180
She's falling!

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:14.270
"Person's weight"

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:16.480
It's just a person's weight dummy.

00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:18.860
I thought it was a giraffe.

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.230
Hey, I guess we didn't
know what we were seeing!

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:25.490
You idiots! How can you look at this
and say it looks like a giraffe!?

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.870
Ah! It's Zenjiro-san!

00:13:27.870 --> 00:13:30.160
I couldn't help myself
from rushing in here!

00:13:30.160 --> 00:13:32.120
Zenjiro-san! Can we have a comment!?

00:13:32.120 --> 00:13:35.790
Do you mind if I take this
person's weight dummy with me?

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:39.130
Zenjiro-chan, get away from them.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:43.130
Oh, I'm Zenjiro's manager,
Higashiyamato Sanekichi--

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.470
Okay, ka-ching!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:47.470
I can't stand it! This has to be
bothering the othuh residents!

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:52.560
"Zenjiro's Room"

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:49.800
Zenjiro-san, please come out!

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:52.560
One statement, please!
Please, Zenjiro-san!

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:58.400
I am Yaginame-e-e-eh,
from the Planet of Goats.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:01.480
I bid you good evening, people of Earth.

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:03.150
Uh, where is Zenjiro-san?

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:06.150
Zenjiro-san is not here.
He has gone on a joiney.

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:07.150
Where to?

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:11.160
--Faw, faw away, to my planet.
--Be back soon!

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:14.160
Okay then, everyone, good evening.

00:14:14.160 --> 00:14:15.500
--Good evening...

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.500
I am going on a joiney too,
on this elevatuh.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.170
Ah, Zenjiro-chan, did it go all right?

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:21.170
Oh, Sane-yan...

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:22.500
--Ah, it's Zenjiro-san!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:25.840
--Uh-oh! They found me out!
--That's entertainment reporters for you.

00:14:25.840 --> 00:14:27.510
Sane-yan, you take it from here.

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.180
Gotcha, gotcha, leave them to me.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.180
--Zenjiro-san!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:35.600
"Meanwhile, Sana-chan was..."

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:34.100
Lasso, lasso, hey!

00:14:34.100 --> 00:14:35.600
What are you doing?

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:38.100
I'll take this.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:40.400
Good choice, boss.
I'll take that one, too.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:43.770
This is the one, right?
I'll put it right here in the basket.

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:44.780
Whoops.

00:14:44.780 --> 00:14:47.440
Don't go taking another one
just because you dropped it.

00:14:47.440 --> 00:14:48.450
I'm putting natto in mine.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.780
In that case, I'm putting
corn flakes in mine.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:54.450
Ah, aloe yogurt! This stuff has
been getting pretty trendy lately.

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.120
Vinegared squid.

00:14:55.120 --> 00:14:56.450
I found it!

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:58.710
Ah, sorry.

00:15:01.130 --> 00:15:03.460
--Zenjiro-san!
--Sana-chan!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.130
Watermelon.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:06.130
What are you doing,
dressed up like that?

00:15:06.130 --> 00:15:08.130
What about you, Zenjiro-san?
What happened?

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:11.800
When you get to be an adult,
you have to go through a lawt of stuff...

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:14.810
Nevuh mind me, though, Sana-chan,
you must be having it rough, right?

00:15:14.810 --> 00:15:16.600
Well, I don't know
if you'd call it rough.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.480
In life a lot can happen, to you.

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:19.600
It shua can.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.350
We both have our troubles, but they
say that rumuhs only last for 75 days.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:23.810
A little time will solve everything.

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:27.530
Anyhow, I'm going to Awstralia
for a little while.

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:28.820
Sana-chan, you hang in there.

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:29.820
Yeah.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.110
Let's hurry and get our shopping done.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:35.120
"Sana and Hayama's ramen"

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:34.120
Are you awake?

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.160
Didn't get enough sleep.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.120
Done!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.790
Done.

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:41.460
I humbly partake!

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:42.120
I humbly partake.

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:44.380
You guys can't even see the noodles,
can you?

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:47.130
That was delicious!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:48.130
Seriously?

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:49.130
That was good.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:52.470
"Still can't sleep"

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:52.510
Be sure to brush your teeth before bed.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.480
--See you.
--Hayama...

00:16:02.480 --> 00:16:03.980
Can I go over there?

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.360
You said that if I asked you
not to do anything,

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:09.820
you wouldn't do anything, right?

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:11.490
You don't trust me, huh?

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.160
Of course not.

00:16:13.160 --> 00:16:15.490
Say, Hayama,

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:18.490
did you notice anything when
you read the table of contents?

00:16:18.490 --> 00:16:19.500
What?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:20.830
In the titles for each chapter.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.170
Just read the first characters.

00:16:23.170 --> 00:16:27.170
Ha-ha-o-ya-na-no-ri-de...
("Mother, come for--")

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:29.840
"Mother, come forward"!

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:34.840
That was the reason for this book.
To find my real mother.

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:40.430
There's a huge chance that we won't
find her, and she could even be dead.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:43.640
Even if she is alive,
she might not be in Japan.

00:16:43.640 --> 00:16:45.770
And even if she is,
she might not read this book.

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.400
And even if she reads it,
she might not come forward.

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:54.780
From what Mama says, there's only about
a five percent chance of us finding her.

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:59.790
Mama overcame that same figure
when she was younger, though.

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:02.450
"I only had a five percent chance
of having a child.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:06.120
Once the doctor told me,
I was despondent over that number."

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:10.380
Mama worked all this time
over that five percent.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.800
Do you want to meet your real mother?

00:17:14.800 --> 00:17:16.720
Mama wants to meet her.

00:17:16.720 --> 00:17:21.720
I also... have a few questions
and things I want to ask her.

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:29.610
But, what if Mama planned someday...
to return me to... my real mother...?

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:34.110
What would I do... if she was planning
to turn me over...?

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:38.410
I've been worrying about that...
all this time...

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:41.080
If you don't want that, then you can just
tell them you don't want to, can't you?

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:44.080
But if that's how Mama feels,
I couldn't say it!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.040
Then I'll tell her for you!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.090
Hayama...

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:54.760
Thanks...

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:57.970
Hayama... I'm so glad...

00:18:09.810 --> 00:18:14.110
Coverage of Kurata Misako-san's essay
had been growing ever more aggressive,

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:16.360
but as a result of a press conference
called by Kamura Naozumi,

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:18.160
it appears to be cooling off
for the moment.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.450
The press conference was held
after the taping of his drama,

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:23.790
when Kamura-kun suddenly and
independently called reporters together.

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:27.460
The agency he is affiliated with
has refused all interviews.

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.500
And so, we now bring you
the press conference

00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:33.090
--held by Kamura Naozumi-kun
a little past 9 o'clock last night.
--Kamura...?

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:36.670
Up to now, I have kept everything
about my profile hidden,

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:39.090
but now, I would like to
speak a little concerning it.

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:41.470
Soon after I was born, I was
abandoned in front of a nursing home,

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:43.100
named Kamura Academy.

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:44.510
Kamura Academy--

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:47.100
that's the home that takes in children
that don't have any relatives.

00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:50.100
It appears that I am half-westerner,
but I really do not know.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:54.440
What? Him, too? Hey...

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:55.690
Does this home have any connection

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:58.110
with the place that took
Sana-chan in for a month?

00:18:58.110 --> 00:19:00.160
I won't say anything about Sana-chan.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:04.790
I will say anything about myself,
so please, stop barging in on Sana-chan.

00:19:04.790 --> 00:19:08.120
I ask you to please
leave Sana-chan alone.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.460
So, Naozumi-kun, you stayed
with Kamura Academy the whole time?
--Naozumi-kun...

00:19:10.460 --> 00:19:12.790
Yes. That is where I grew up.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:15.090
Now, my dream is to take a
more active role in the world,

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:17.130
and give something back to the academy.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:19.470
I haven't really thought of myself
as being unfortunate.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:22.140
I'm sure there are people
who are less fortunate than I,

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:23.140
who do have both their parents.

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:25.140
Naozumi! See here!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:26.850
This is where his manager
stepped in to stop him,

00:19:26.850 --> 00:19:28.480
and the press conference came to an end.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:31.350
Reactions by Kamura-kun's fans
have been mixed.

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:35.400
Actually, I wish he hadn't
said anything, even if it is true.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:37.730
He seemed like a prince
from another country.

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:40.070
So what? It doesn't make any difference.

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:43.410
He's just trying to
protect Sana-chan, isn't he?

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:45.080
Once in a while,

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.740
we bring you news about a newborn
who has been left abandoned somewhere,

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:48.750
but for us to report the news

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:53.750
--that two of them have grown up to be
such fine, famous people is unusual.
--Why did he have to say that...?

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:58.920
--It's not usually something
you'd go public with, huh?
--I've dragged Naozumi-kun into this, now.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:03.430
Somehow, I'm not quite
following the whole situation,

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:07.100
but you don't have to worry about this.
He did what he did all on his own.

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:10.100
Ah! I overslept! Akito, are you awake!?

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:11.770
--Yeah!
--Dad!

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:13.100
--Well, I'm going to school.
--Dad!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:16.110
You take it easy. How often do
you get the chance, after all?

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:21.110
Naozumi!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.820
How could you do such a thing
on your own!? I can't believe you!

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.740
"Manager's head"

00:20:24.110 --> 00:20:26.780
Hey, are you listening to me!? Hey!
Huh? You aren't listening to me, huh!?

00:20:26.780 --> 00:20:31.120
Hayama is the one who got
Sana-chan out of that media siege.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:35.420
--Sana-chan is probably still
over at Hayama's house now.
--Naozumi! What's wrong with you?

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:39.590
That can't be helped. Right now,
he is closer to Sana-chan than I am.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:42.590
But I will protect Sana-chan
in my own way.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:49.390
I wish you would break that
habit of playing your trumpet

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:51.100
whenever you get wound up!

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:54.810
I'm trying to pass you off as a bishonen,
and that just looks weird!

00:20:59.780 --> 00:21:02.110
--Yes, Kurata residence.
--I guess we owe it to Naozumi-kun.

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:05.450
--Yes... Yes... Yes, but... Yes...
--The press has been reduced quite a bit.

00:21:05.450 --> 00:21:08.780
What is it, Shimura-san? Who is it?

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:11.580
Well, she won't tell me her name,

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.460
but she says she would
like to speak with the madam.

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:15.920
Her voice sounds like a young woman.

00:21:22.460 --> 00:21:26.470
♪ Everyone is at school, studying! ♪

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.470
♪ I'm staying home at the Hayama house! ♪

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:30.470
♪ The weather is nice, and I'm
lounging around someone else's house! ♪

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:32.970
♪ For lunch, I'm having a nori bento lunch
with Hayama's sister! ♪

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:39.150
You've reached the Hayamas.
We're not home. Please leave a message.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:42.150
This is Sagami. Thank you
for looking after Sana-chan.

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:43.490
Please contact me as soon as possible.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:45.150
Rei-kun!

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.160
It really was surprising, you know?

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:49.830
Not just Sana-chan,
but now Naozumi-kun, too.

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:52.490
But I'm sure that Naozumi-kun
did it for Sana-chan--

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:56.830
Akito-kun, something happened
with Sana-chan, huh?

00:21:56.830 --> 00:22:00.500
Tsuyoshi, I'm going home early,
so tell the teacher for me.

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:02.210
Akito-kun!

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:06.510
Kurata!

00:22:06.510 --> 00:22:07.430
What's wrong?

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:12.390
They said they found my mother.

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:23.780
Somehow, it's all too soon...

00:22:23.780 --> 00:22:26.150
I don't want to meet her yet.

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:32.280
I can't! I can't do it! Not yet!

00:22:33.790 --> 00:22:35.700
What good will running away do?

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:41.540
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:47.050
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:51.760
In dire straits,

00:22:52.510 --> 00:22:55.350
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:55.850 --> 00:22:59.230
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:04.320
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:10.360
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:10.610 --> 00:23:12.570
...panic!!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:18.410
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:18.620 --> 00:23:21.080
he's there.

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:24.380
And our usual classroom...

00:23:24.590 --> 00:23:26.960
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.050 --> 00:23:29.470
...for two.

00:23:30.300 --> 00:23:32.930
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.140 --> 00:23:37.680
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:41.270
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:45.980
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:51.570
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:51.740 --> 00:23:54.240
he's there,

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:57.410
And our usual classroom...

00:23:57.660 --> 00:24:00.000
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:02.500
...for two.

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:09.920
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:15.140
My summer...
It started with a promise...

00:24:15.140 --> 00:24:17.140
The dazzling, brilliant sky, and the
white clouds that kindly protected me,

00:24:17.140 --> 00:24:19.810
are now both about to pass me by.

00:24:19.810 --> 00:24:23.020
My summer... has come to an end...

00:24:24.150 --> 00:24:28.820
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode 19;
the fated series reaches its conclusion.

00:24:28.820 --> 00:24:30.820
"The Daughter Cries,
and the Mother Cries, Too"

00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:33.910
This has been the white bat,
Babbi-- waahh!
